{"id":"vod_sn_38453","vodId":"38453","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"横山光辉 三国志","name_cn":"横山光辉 三国志","date":"1991-01-01","year":"1991","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/97fa8c9654ee590b35ec69cb95eca627.jpg"},"summary":"东汉末年，刘室王朝气数已尽，内有十常侍祸乱朝纲，颠倒黑白；外有张角兄弟扯起“苍天已死，黄巾当立，岁在甲子，天下大吉”的叛旗；更有一代权臣董卓只手遮天，引起各地豪杰的不满，交替上演群雄逐鹿的大戏。在此期间，汉室宗亲中山靖王之后刘备玄德（中村大树 配音）结识了张飞翼德（藤原启治 配音）和关羽云长（辻親八 配音），三人相见恨晚，在桃园结为兄弟。三兄弟以平定黄巾军起家，逐渐成为裂土称霸的一方枭雄。在之后的漫长岁月里，袁术、袁绍、曹操、孙策、孙权、诸葛亮、周瑜、赵云等乱世豪杰相继登场，上演了流传千古的三国演义……　　本片为日本漫画家横山光辉根据中国古典四大名著之一的《三国演义》创作的漫画《三国志》的动画版。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":47,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hKpuE4AiWy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nYKjviZp081/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KzmVasukHF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DP5Z9VmByZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MAhjimr53H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FQQyD6HL5h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/B1KNtMJpsW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gyhwQXRavY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SdgM0LhG1q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1SYDZjjkxV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/D2yZQ85T0y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FpuFRHmYnt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PNgC1cNmvk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kWas5jCqWT1/video/index